iommu-map-pa (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename: source and binary package upcie-iommu-map(-dkms) -> iommu-map-pa(-dkms).
  * Module upcie_iommu_map -> iommu_map_pa; device node /dev/iommu_map_pa.
  * ioctls renamed IOMMU_MAP_PA / IOMMU_UNMAP_PA and structs iommu_map_pa_req /
    iommu_unmap_pa_req; magic and numbers unchanged.
  * UAPI header now installs as /usr/include/linux/iommu_map_pa.h, and the
    userspace wrapper as /usr/include/upcie/experimental/iommu_map_pa.h.
  * Access is governed by the 0600 node mode and an optional udev rule, with an
    example shipped in the docdir.

 -- Simon A. F. Lund <os@safl.dk>  Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:00:00 +0200

